# D420 (Plan 204) / Plan 233 §2а (renamed): machine-local [replace] +
# [net] proxy overrides — never committed (dev-only overrides on top of a
# package's release git+version dep / env proxy). nova.override.toml is
# the current canonical name; nova.local.toml kept for the transitional
# period (old name still read by the tooling with a deprecation warning).
nova.override.toml
nova.local.toml

